<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>To 18-127v-3</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/4934fe1e-b956-4e94-9998-a60be423a9ce</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Michael Klaper</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Gunilla Iversen</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Ritva Maria Jacobsson</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-ba75bc43-2b73-4c0e-8d1b-032e246bd137" endid="#m-5eb33c99-0d9b-47bb-90c2-c4cd98e46962" corresp="#m-comment-0"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-0-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Diese Einsatzmarke stimmt melodisch nicht mit dem Bezugsgesang (((To 18-37-7))) überein. Vermutlich versehentlich wurde hier die Melodie der Communio [[Laetabitur iustus]] statt des Introitus eingesetzt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-07362104-ea3a-41f1-a135-ea714f15cea9" endid="#m-aa5d8387-d506-4764-a5e6-a27de622ffd6" corresp="#m-comment-1"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-1-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Die Angabe des Psalmtons ist inkonsistent: Der Beginn entspricht dem 5. Ton, passend zu der Communio-Melodie, die Schlusskadenz entspricht dem 8. Ton, passend zur Introitus-Melodie.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>((7, 8, 9:)) Hexameter.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-to-18"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">To 18</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>To 18-127v-3</identifier><title>Culminibus caeli</title><incip><incipText><p>Culminibus caeli</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="127v">f. 127v, l. 3</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Laetabitur intr 7 A 8 B 9 C D (CT X)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-4</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Bertulfus</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Michael Klaper</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">To 18-37-7-</term><term type="Endseite">127v</term><term type="Endzeile">6</term><term type="FestUndGattung">Laetabitur intr</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">To 18</identifier><titleStmt><title>To 18</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Bobbio</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen italienischer Herkunft</geogName><corpName role="origin-institution">Abtei San Colombano</corpName><date>11. Jh – 12. Jh</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Graduale, Tropar, Sequentiar, Kyriale</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Ms. F IV 18</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Torino</geogName><corpName>Biblioteca Nazionale Universitaria</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></